# Lesson 14 local artifacts.
#
# out/    watermarked remediation output from m14_visual_policy.py
# .cache/ content-hashed responses so a retake is instant and identical
#
# Both are derived state. `--clean` on any script deletes them for you, so you
# never have to remember a manual rm before a take.
out/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
audit.jsonl
